o3d 2
# A three-part skinned fixture (tests/threedi/o3d_cli_test.cpp --skinned):
# part 0 the root bone, part 1 a child bone, part 2 the mesh part the mesh is
# authored on. The builder moves strip ownership to the root ROBJ and keeps
# the bounds on part 2 (the retail skinned layout). A skinned vertex gives its
# influences as part weight pairs, the primary first; the lowering makes the
# strip's bone table from them (the second vertex rides parts 0 and 1 half and
# half).
model SKIN
skinned 1
material VS_SKBASIC
texture skin.tga
lod 128 gnrc
part 0 0 0 0
part 0 0 0 1
part 0 0 0 -1
mesh 0 0
v 1 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1
v -1 1 0 0 0 1 0 1 0 0.5 1 0.5
v -1 -1 1 0 0 1 1 1 1 1
v 1 -1 1 0 0 1 1 0 1 0.75 0 0.25
t 0 1 2
t 0 2 3
panm 0 0
panm 1 0
panm 2 0
cobj 0 0 0 0
csphere 0 0 0 0.5
cobj 0 0 0 1
csphere 0 0 1 0.25
cobj 0 0 0 -1
cv 1 1 0
cv -1 1 0
cv -1 -1 1
cf 0 1 2 1
